                                "sense_id": "81bd8521-7563-3b31-960b-d8037bb6467a",
                                "text": "Having obtained the loan of a horse one holyday, he rode into a \"faire forest,\" where, overcome by the heat, he lay down under the shade of a tree and meditated on his wretched state."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fa1606b-b62e-49a1-ab8e-003c1a2ac58e",
                                "sense_id": "81bd8521-7563-3b31-960b-d8037bb6467a",
                                "text": "[…] they were soon on the beautiful common leading to Roehampton, where villas, which seem, like Beatrice's idea of King Pedro for a husband, made only for holydays […]"
